        "id": 1945845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-26T23:12:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With the bug (https://issuetracker.google.com/issue?id\u003d230529320\u0026query\u003d230529320) opened to track my concern, I\u0027m fine with this change.",
      "revId": "32787ef6d205242bbf1105720319d57da552e78f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "56161be1_3cf51f67",
        "filename": "BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 32,
      "author": {
        "id": 1945845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-26T22:36:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just generating the working config for a device can be a pain, so maintaining this list of ko files seems like it will be very laborious (with consequence of missing just one causing the device to stop booting). So this feels a bit fragile. Is there any easier way to capture the generated device driver modules without having to enumerate them?",
      "revId": "32787ef6d205242bbf1105720319d57da552e78f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "50197266_e9f0568c",
        "filename": "BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 32,
      "author": {
        "id": 1121838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-26T22:43:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason of this is the following:\n\n- Bazel requires the list of outputs to be listed\n- We also want to keep track of the list and ensure the change is deliberate.\n\nHence Matthias and I decide to ask developers to maintain this list, unlike in build.sh.\n\nCurrently, if the list is out-dated (e.g. a new module is built or a module is removed), a build error is raised when running the Bazel build.\n\nI am also going to add build test to postsubmit then presubmit. But it\u0027ll still need developers to update the list.\n\nStill, I think your point is absolutely valid. Filing Bug:230529320 to keep track of potentially removing this.",
      "parentUuid": "56161be1_3cf51f67",
      "revId": "32787ef6d205242bbf1105720319d57da552e78f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7e6e81c5_eb158aee",
        "filename": "BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 32,
      "author": {
        "id": 1121838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-26T22:45:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, I missed one point here:\n\nIf the list is missing certain items, the error message will contain a list of items that a developer can copy-and-paste into the BUILD.bazel file to get it updated.",
      "parentUuid": "50197266_e9f0568c",
      "revId": "32787ef6d205242bbf1105720319d57da552e78f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4cd29bc7_b0d5a48d",
        "filename": "BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 32,
