        "id": 1121838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-26T22:46:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The error looks something like this:\n\n```\nERROR: The following kernel modules are built but not copied. Add these lines to the module_outs attribute of //common:db845c:\n    \"drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-lpass-lpi.ko\",\n    \"drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-sdm845.ko\",\n    [...]\n```",
      "parentUuid": "7e6e81c5_eb158aee",
      "revId": "32787ef6d205242bbf1105720319d57da552e78f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
